config:
  themeVariables:
    noteBkgColor: "#f7f7f7"
    noteTextColor: "#333333"
    noteBorderColor: "#999999"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Administrator
    participant B as Browser (React app)
    participant L as Laravel API
    participant C as VenueClashes
    participant D as MySQL
    A->>B: Enter the event's venue, date and time
    Note over B: Waits 0.4 s after each change
    B->>L: GET /api/event-clashes (venue, dates, times)
    L->>C: Find bookings that clash with this one
    C->>D: Other bookings at the same venue on overlapping days, not cancelled
    D-->>C: Bookings
    C->>C: Keep those with the same room (or no room) and overlapping hours
    C-->>L: Clashing bookings
    L-->>B: JSON list of clashes
    alt One or more clashes
        B-->>A: Overlap warning, naming each booking ("You can still save it")
    else No clash
        B-->>A: No warning
    end
    A->>B: Click "Add event"
    B->>L: POST /api/events + token
    L->>L: Check the role (Administrator) and validate the details
    L->>L: Set the status from the date (upcoming, or completed if already over)
    L->>D: Save the event
    D-->>L: Saved event
    L-->>B: 201 Created, with the event
    B-->>A: "Event added", and the Schedule and calendar show it
